\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiwHUj4UcmnE0clDUxrU7Yq3miJYhm4DLURIQNPu-BLFLWRUTXjxw3zutyEQlioPoPZMCGxpIMT8AB88Oed0RvLpWtEJAluWRhkriNzjzztCzfym3eUVGEX-44tED7ImpTYxSOv90A_yiwSHQAZ1QIZEIgrHeblbI9W7rlvstJPQSK31xv176xBCTHT8_Jj/s320/%E5%AE%AE%E5%9F%8E%E8%AD%B7%E5%9C%8B%E7%A5%9E%E7%A4%BE1.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj3tCjnpiOw9lEEBm1diwwLFJMF1Jl-F8dKfyXqNBSccKBsxUlFhXMyozSJtghceoJgXQPsr9V4IX9sascr2Vm5CXtsdyHz0a3Z6CBIjTLxRg0fEtgeaeGKK9Tf67Z3rEydOrU8Qo8KQIc8w-_3pQSA9AjdVMzUTgiJhZDI_08yW6OT4bKkxT9l4aYqWWV_/s1200/%E9%A8%B0%E5%8E%9F%E4%B9%8B%E9%84%89%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"900\" data-original-width=\"1200\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj3tCjnpiOw9lEEBm1diwwLFJMF1Jl-F8dKfyXqNBSccKBsxUlFhXMyozSJtghceoJgXQPsr9V4IX9sascr2Vm5CXtsdyHz0a3Z6CBIjTLxRg0fEtgeaeGKK9Tf67Z3rEydOrU8Qo8KQIc8w-_3pQSA9AjdVMzUTgiJhZDI_08yW6OT4bKkxT9l4aYqWWV_/s320/%E9%A8%B0%E5%8E%9F%E4%B9%8B%E9%84%89%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg25jJOufywbKg1i6l72eMlwto3IppKZt1pmH0qK6jegy6OngblM-GLLVUQEWTzCgf6ZLyuzaa3iNba2_9JmzBbcaoSohc1shH0zryFuG4MO8i2NwM0EAsfHmuR1BJPjXLaNxyNSmgbsgkFI3zMdcEflvW5LpFCgrPvY3GJuaj7gwFLhfyPfCJD84avYS0D/s4080/%E9%A8%B0%E5%8E%9F%E4%B9%8B%E9%84%89%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E9%A4%A82.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3060\" data-original-width=\"4080\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg25jJOufywbKg1i6l72eMlwto3IppKZt1pmH0qK6jegy6OngblM-GLLVUQEWTzCgf6ZLyuzaa3iNba2_9JmzBbcaoSohc1shH0zryFuG4MO8i2NwM0EAsfHmuR1BJPjXLaNxyNSmgbsgkFI3zMdcEflvW5LpFCgrPvY3GJuaj7gwFLhfyPfCJD84avYS0D/s320/%E9%A8%B0%E5%8E%9F%E4%B9%8B%E9%84%89%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E9%A4%A82.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><p><br /></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啟程</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日本東北環境幽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">慕名sio招來旅遊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tn̄g著風颱令人憂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">佳哉雨鬚來做收</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天公伯--à有保庇</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溫度二五好天氣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sap-sap仔雨tài詩意</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無風無搖出門去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">東北行政分六縣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">福島岩手宮城縣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">山形秋田青森縣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">地闊平原kah山巒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">仙台縣</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭工仙台機場落</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">飯店花卷千秋閣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">暗頓料理食真好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蟳管海產sut tshit-thô</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">秋田縣</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">透早來到秋田縣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">駐車角館歷史村</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">百年垂櫻se̍h河川</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">參觀武家道具館</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">展示青柳家兵器</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">戰甲質堅歷史記</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭盔刀劍身不離</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮mā戴來以身試</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人力車是等在邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">正雄紘騰興tshih-tshih</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">半行半走真趣味</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">享受兩爿風微微</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日本上深田沢湖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">遠山近水一幅圖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">魚蝦水產生態顧</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中晝tī tsia硩腹肚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青森縣</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青森出名是蘋果</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">也有大粒水蜜桃</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">銷往台灣眾人褒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">在地享受有夠好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奧入瀨溪</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奧入瀨溪好景觀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溪床兩爿是山巒</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溪水清清溪面彎</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">楓樹下跤人行緩</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">峽谷崎崎徛兩邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溪水平流順溪墘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">水tshiâng百丈直拄天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青苔tshiūnn kah青青青</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">春芽嫩綠m̄驚冷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">秋楓落葉戲水影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">冬去春來換新景</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">四季遊客來bē停</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">引用十合田湖水</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溢出水口後浪推</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">萬水爭流大海歸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">川流不息有夠suí</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">遊湖行程tī下晡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">搭乘遊艇來se̍h湖</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">湖光山色眼底鋪</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">圍se̍h小島飯店渡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">岩手縣</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">今日日本是好天</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">東北4點天光時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生理時鐘錯亂--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiah早起--來創啥mi̍h？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">中尊寺</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">世界遺產中尊寺</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">極樂淨土受重視</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主神如來tsia安置</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">金色堂頂金箔披</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">猊鼻溪</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">夢幻溪谷猊鼻溪</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">溪水淨流遊客濟</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">船頂一位撐渡伯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">撐船唱歌古業繼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">宮城縣</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">護國神社tī宮城</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khah早叫做招魂社</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一九三九年改名</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">各縣全有m̄免驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">弧形厝頂配銅瓦</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">紅色木樑外觀hiánn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">明治維新犧牲者</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">數萬烈士tsia留名</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">松島</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日本三景松島彎</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">名聲遠播不虛傳</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">松樹徛thîng蔚奇觀</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">遊艇穿梭視覺遠</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">回程</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">旅遊使人腦智活</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日本台灣多文化</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就ài出門sì-kè看</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">互相交流智識換</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無論語言iah是歌</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">異國情懷連sio倚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風土民情sio放伴</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">承先啟後代代湠</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEil6F6PvRU-b1RX9QKqGYIWeeu9TO5W5xUqt3g1NLUfMrcZDOODqdqIMQnUrQ8jrh2Jz-8dosJ7iWltQSs0DWBmBVNRYFLdGMGG24tPJoH1DWWkUbKXAqsdbYKxE9BJuYxh14JRosr2OW1vjjvzrPavq9PaP-SdaGCIHtEk7V9WdB7FrZb5jwvPJ6iob57g/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_36.jpg\